From feb5aa04c83e73a93498e74eb2590d66d23c509a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:06:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/45] Send rally points, template data and stats in the
 Specula feed

Kind 12 group 1048576 carries each building's RallyPoint positions with
the path CCmpRallyPointRenderer computes to them (footprint edge,
ComputePathImmediate, averaging, ReduceSegmentsByVisibility,
InterpolatePointsRNS) and the flag actor of the owner's civ, sampled
every 5 turns and cached until the points, the building or its owner
change. Kind 11 adds the RallyPointRenderer line texture, mask,
thickness and caps.

Kind 18 sends GetTemplateData for each entity's template and trainable
item for its owner, again when IsTemplateModified holds (then
ResetTemplateModified, which nothing else calls here), and kind 19 each
researchable technology's data for the civ. Kind 20 interns the
attack and resistance part of GetEntityState, read every 25 turns, and
group 2097152 names it. New kinds and group bits, so the feed stays v14.
